WEBVTT

00:11.968 --> 00:18.016
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

00:18.944 --> 00:21.653
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

00:22.498 --> 00:27.040
♪A brilliant scenery♪

00:27.744 --> 00:33.518
♪Moonlight spills over
the endless clear sky♪

00:34.349 --> 00:42.496
♪The roar of the heartbeat
leaves a trace behind♪

00:44.032 --> 00:49.566
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

00:51.616 --> 00:57.786
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

00:59.520 --> 01:02.624
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

01:03.040 --> 01:07.085
♪Fervent, boiling love♪

01:07.776 --> 01:11.760
♪How you long for the future♪

01:12.128 --> 01:15.328
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

01:15.520 --> 01:18.475
♪Fall in my heart♪

01:18.475 --> 01:22.816
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

01:23.328 --> 01:27.297
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

01:27.566 --> 01:33.940
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

01:33.940 --> 01:39.040
=Be Passionately in Love=

01:40.510 --> 01:47.064
=Episode 17=
(Every Step He Takes Is Towards You)

01:52.286 --> 01:53.366
What will you do later?

01:57.005 --> 01:58.005
Homework?

01:59.366 --> 02:00.646
You stay up late every day

02:00.726 --> 02:01.806
for homework?

02:03.726 --> 02:05.966
Every time I tell others
I am from Qingyi,

02:06.125 --> 02:07.646
someone always asks me a question.

02:07.726 --> 02:08.846
Do you know what it is?

02:09.605 --> 02:10.926
"Are you from No.1 High School?"

02:12.045 --> 02:13.565
No.1 High School produces brainiacs.

02:13.645 --> 02:16.165
No.1 High School's students
always emphasize where they're from,

02:16.806 --> 02:17.806
as if

02:18.446 --> 02:20.446
no other school can represent Qingyi.

02:21.045 --> 02:23.605
They easily erase the efforts of others.

02:24.286 --> 02:25.886
So you want to work harder

02:26.205 --> 02:27.446
to let those people realize

02:27.766 --> 02:29.125
their superiority is ridiculous.

02:29.205 --> 02:30.166
Of course.

02:30.246 --> 02:31.406
Capability counts more.

02:32.005 --> 02:33.766
How about we make a bet?

02:34.886 --> 02:35.525
Bet on what?

02:35.645 --> 02:37.085
On who does better in the midterms.

02:37.485 --> 02:40.286
You represent No.1 High School,
and I represent Ruijun School.

02:41.846 --> 02:42.846
I see.

02:44.246 --> 02:45.605
Without getting a result,

02:45.685 --> 02:46.806
you don't plan to date.

02:51.005 --> 02:52.005
Alright.

02:52.966 --> 02:55.125
Dating and kissing are both boring.

02:55.485 --> 02:56.886
Kissing while dating is boring.

02:56.966 --> 02:58.405
Only kissing without dating is fun.

02:58.485 --> 02:59.485
Right?

02:59.886 --> 03:01.406
We have already kissed just now.

03:01.605 --> 03:02.605
I feel

03:03.485 --> 03:04.485
it's just like that.

03:05.926 --> 03:06.645
What do you mean?

03:06.886 --> 03:07.886
What do you think?

03:08.326 --> 03:10.846
It means that kissing without dating

03:10.926 --> 03:11.926
is also boring.

03:12.726 --> 03:14.326
Not dating but doing something else

03:14.645 --> 03:15.645
might be fun.

03:17.005 --> 03:18.485
Don't push it, alright?

03:25.406 --> 03:26.485
Would you like to

03:26.605 --> 03:28.125
plan the next investment fair with me?

03:28.366 --> 03:29.366
Sorry.

03:29.446 --> 03:30.645
I may not be able to.

03:31.005 --> 03:32.565
I have too much homework recently.

03:32.645 --> 03:33.247
With me,

03:33.327 --> 03:34.685
chatting to another boy on WeChat?

03:35.205 --> 03:36.205
You are quite bold.

03:36.525 --> 03:37.525
Come on.

03:37.806 --> 03:39.485
You didn't take him seriously at all.

03:42.246 --> 03:43.326
What are you snorting at?

03:43.766 --> 03:44.846
You little sourpickle.

03:46.726 --> 03:48.085
Yeah, he's a pickle.

03:48.205 --> 03:49.246
And he's boring.

03:49.966 --> 03:51.246
He wanted a proper relationship.

03:51.326 --> 03:52.165
And what happened?

03:52.286 --> 03:54.246
He found out the girl likes excitement.

03:54.525 --> 03:55.525
Right?

03:55.806 --> 03:56.687
He feared

03:56.767 --> 03:58.045
they may break up soon.

03:58.726 --> 03:59.846
Even sending that girl

03:59.926 --> 04:01.326
a WeChat message would take ages.

04:01.685 --> 04:04.165
He feared she'd get bored
if he talked too much

04:04.246 --> 04:05.886
or feel ignored if he talked too little.

04:06.806 --> 04:07.647
All his attention

04:07.727 --> 04:09.125
was put on that girl.

04:09.205 --> 04:09.806
And then?

04:10.085 --> 04:11.406
That girl simply said

04:12.246 --> 04:13.246
he's a sourpickle.

04:13.726 --> 04:15.286
Wouldn't you say he's unlucky?

04:18.246 --> 04:19.366
Do you really think so?

04:21.806 --> 04:22.806
What a poor guy.

04:25.645 --> 04:27.125
If we were like this our whole lives,

04:27.205 --> 04:28.152
wouldn't it be nice?

04:28.806 --> 04:29.806
What's nice about it?

04:30.326 --> 04:31.926
Of course not.
Don't even think about it.

04:34.605 --> 04:36.605
You think a lot, don't you?

04:37.085 --> 04:38.366
But even if we got together

04:38.446 --> 04:39.685
and then broke up, as you said,

04:39.926 --> 04:40.926
you'll get something.

04:41.085 --> 04:42.886
Being the first love ex-boyfriend

04:43.246 --> 04:44.206
to me, Xu Zhi,

04:44.286 --> 04:45.966
would sound cool.

04:47.045 --> 04:49.125
It does sound better than school hunk

04:49.205 --> 04:50.205
or class hunk.

04:50.766 --> 04:51.846
After all, you are

04:51.926 --> 04:53.685
the famously beautiful Xu Zhi

04:53.886 --> 04:55.766
from kindergarten onwards.

04:57.326 --> 04:58.406
Look at you.

04:58.565 --> 04:59.926
If you spoke without snark,

05:00.406 --> 05:01.605
you would have a girlfriend.

05:01.926 --> 05:02.966
I can change now.

05:03.525 --> 05:04.525
It's too late.

05:05.085 --> 05:06.085
Wait to be summoned.

05:06.605 --> 05:07.605
Bye.

05:10.886 --> 05:11.886
Good night.

06:00.184 --> 06:03.416
(Chen Luzhou
Other Stickers)

06:17.645 --> 06:18.406
You look happy.

06:18.645 --> 06:19.926
Got back together with Xu Zhi?

06:32.606 --> 06:40.184
(Timetable for Huaguang University's
School of Architecture's Courses)

06:41.326 --> 06:42.485
(Zhu Yangqi will come soon.)

06:42.846 --> 06:44.406
(Let's go eat pork chop together.)

06:56.005 --> 06:57.005
Long time no see.

06:58.886 --> 06:59.366
Let's go.

06:59.726 --> 07:00.726
Let's go.

07:08.926 --> 07:10.085
What are you doing?

07:10.165 --> 07:11.165
You didn't reply to me.

07:12.085 --> 07:13.085
What are you looking at?

07:17.366 --> 07:18.525
Why are you so slow today?

07:18.966 --> 07:20.165
Did you get hurt, huh?

07:25.326 --> 07:26.326
Tan Xu?

07:28.886 --> 07:30.525
Should we call him over then?

07:30.766 --> 07:31.966
We four can make a table.

07:33.246 --> 07:34.565
Don't look for trouble.

07:36.766 --> 07:37.207
Wait.

07:37.287 --> 07:38.766
How is this looking for trouble?

07:39.005 --> 07:40.726
An old classmate has come to Beijing.

07:41.005 --> 07:42.726
Inviting him for a meal is quite normal.

07:43.806 --> 07:44.806
No, not normal at all.

07:45.846 --> 07:47.806
Shouldn't Tan Xu
be repeating the course now?

07:48.005 --> 07:49.085
Why did he come to Beijing?

07:49.605 --> 07:51.446
Why did he come to Huaguang University?

07:52.286 --> 07:54.005
What is the reason?

07:54.685 --> 07:55.846
Isn't the answer obvious?

07:57.846 --> 07:58.846
That is,

07:59.645 --> 08:01.565
he specifically came for Xu Zhi.

08:03.726 --> 08:04.726
Will you order or not?

08:05.366 --> 08:06.366
Yes.

08:14.246 --> 08:15.246
Sorry.

08:15.446 --> 08:17.165
It was abrupt
to suddenly come to see you.

08:17.846 --> 08:19.165
But you're the only friend

08:19.245 --> 08:20.486
I know in Beijing now.

08:21.486 --> 08:23.125
Why did you suddenly come to Beijing?

08:25.926 --> 08:27.686
Retaking the course is harder
than I thought.

08:28.646 --> 08:30.005
So I wanted

08:30.205 --> 08:32.445
to come see my ideal university

08:33.125 --> 08:34.165
to find some motivation.

08:34.926 --> 08:36.405
Your mock exam results aren't good?

08:40.005 --> 08:41.365
Not just that.

08:41.445 --> 08:43.045
They're getting worse and worse.

08:44.045 --> 08:45.045
And I can't focus.

08:46.686 --> 08:49.005
I feel I'm getting further
from my parents' expectations.

08:49.766 --> 08:51.646
It's like I've hit a dead end.

08:52.125 --> 08:53.285
Have you thought about

08:53.365 --> 08:54.766
what you are studying for?

08:55.285 --> 08:56.806
Are you doing it for yourself

08:56.886 --> 08:58.245
or for your parents?

09:00.686 --> 09:01.726
Sometimes, you don't

09:01.806 --> 09:03.486
have to care about what people think.

09:04.045 --> 09:06.085
Just do what you want to do.

09:15.445 --> 09:16.445
He can dream on.

09:17.486 --> 09:18.486
Whether he can get

09:18.566 --> 09:20.405
into Huaguang University
is still uncertain.

09:21.005 --> 09:22.045
Why did he come to Xu Zhi?

09:22.325 --> 09:23.325
To talk big game.

09:26.646 --> 09:28.486
If he really came
to talk big game to Xu Zhi,

09:28.566 --> 09:30.005
I would donate some cilantro to him.

09:30.686 --> 09:31.766
Xu Zhi loves to eat it.

09:34.526 --> 09:35.766
Excuse me, gentlemen.

09:35.846 --> 09:36.846
Here is your cold dish.

09:36.926 --> 09:37.926
Thank you.

09:39.405 --> 09:40.405
Where's the vinegar?

09:40.606 --> 09:41.726
Sorry, I'll get it now.

09:42.566 --> 09:44.405
No worries, I'll just dip it in him.

09:46.566 --> 09:47.526
Just joking.

09:47.606 --> 09:48.886
You go get it. Thanks.

09:52.846 --> 09:54.125
Eat.

09:55.005 --> 09:56.005
Thank you.

09:56.165 --> 09:57.486
This trip wasn't in vain.

09:59.125 --> 10:00.125
Keep it up.

10:01.245 --> 10:01.806
By the way,

10:02.245 --> 10:03.726
is Chen Luzhou here too?

10:04.005 --> 10:05.566
Yes, and you know about it too?

10:07.726 --> 10:09.405
After all, he's Chen Luzhou.

10:11.405 --> 10:12.405
(De Sica)
Chen Luzhou,

10:12.846 --> 10:14.245
at a time like this,

10:14.726 --> 10:16.325
you skipped class for a movie?

10:16.526 --> 10:17.846
The exams are coming up.

10:18.566 --> 10:20.606
And this... De Sica?

10:21.566 --> 10:24.205
Can De Sica teach you trigonometry

10:24.285 --> 10:25.285
or solid geometry?

10:25.486 --> 10:26.886
Can De Sica take the exams for you?

10:28.486 --> 10:29.526
Let's make a bet, sir.

10:30.886 --> 10:31.566
Bet on what?

10:31.766 --> 10:33.085
If I get first place

10:33.445 --> 10:35.045
in next month's IMO,

10:35.165 --> 10:36.165
you need to give me

10:36.245 --> 10:37.245
a movie leave next time.

10:37.526 --> 10:38.766
Deal.

10:38.846 --> 10:40.165
First place for a movie leave.

10:40.245 --> 10:41.245
Keep your word.

10:42.325 --> 10:44.045
Alright, I'm off.

10:45.165 --> 10:46.165
See you, Mr. Zhang.

10:47.005 --> 10:48.005
Is it really a deal?

10:53.085 --> 10:54.966
(Actually,
I've always envied Chen Luzhou.)

10:55.325 --> 10:56.445
In him,

10:56.766 --> 10:59.606
you can always see that kind
of relaxed determination.

11:00.766 --> 11:02.165
It's like he can accomplish

11:02.245 --> 11:03.686
everything without effort.

11:05.125 --> 11:06.205
But I can't do that.

11:07.405 --> 11:08.606
I can't

11:08.806 --> 11:10.245
view gains and losses so lightly.

11:11.566 --> 11:12.886
Many people think of Chen Luzhou

11:12.966 --> 11:14.125
as a talented player

11:14.245 --> 11:15.566
who can win first place easily.

11:16.285 --> 11:18.165
But everyone ignores his efforts.

11:18.646 --> 11:19.686
In his senior year,

11:19.926 --> 11:21.365
he would sleep at 3 or 4 AM

11:21.646 --> 11:23.165
and get up at eight for school.

11:23.726 --> 11:24.647
And in senior year,

11:24.727 --> 11:26.606
he solved about 8,000 problems
in science alone.

11:27.245 --> 11:28.886
He got in here by add-on admission.

11:29.486 --> 11:30.486
I know about that.

11:30.726 --> 11:31.846
In many people's eyes,

11:32.846 --> 11:34.285
he could go abroad

11:34.365 --> 11:36.245
and get into Huaguang University
as he wanted.

11:36.445 --> 11:37.445
But they don't know

11:37.606 --> 11:39.766
he switched to his dream major
in his sophomore year.

11:39.966 --> 11:41.445
To catch up with the courses,

11:41.526 --> 11:42.566
he put in a lot of effort.

11:42.646 --> 11:44.125
It's just that he never mentions it.

11:51.245 --> 11:52.686
In this way,

11:53.045 --> 11:54.405
you two are quite similar.

11:56.566 --> 11:58.005
Sir, here is your vinegar.

11:58.846 --> 11:59.846
Thank you.

12:09.405 --> 12:10.646
This vinegar is really strong.

12:11.405 --> 12:12.606
You talk a lot.

12:12.926 --> 12:14.646
You've been
looking handsome lately, Lucy.

12:14.886 --> 12:16.045
Stop flattering me.

12:19.886 --> 12:20.886
Lucy, the truth is,

12:21.886 --> 12:23.846
ever since you came back from Europe,

12:25.125 --> 12:26.165
your fashion sense

12:26.245 --> 12:27.405
has become so debatable.

12:27.726 --> 12:29.526
Can you wear a white shirt,

12:29.606 --> 12:30.606
dude?

12:30.806 --> 12:32.526
You dress so casually every day.

12:34.045 --> 12:35.285
With such a good shape,

12:35.405 --> 12:37.245
not wearing a white shirt
is a total waste.

12:38.045 --> 12:39.486
Why wear a white shirt?

12:39.726 --> 12:40.766
To imitate Tan Xu?

12:41.526 --> 12:43.445
Wearing a shirt alone
is not imitating Tan Xu.

12:44.726 --> 12:46.285
Suits and shirts

12:46.526 --> 12:47.846
are the standard for a cool man.

12:48.205 --> 12:49.205
Right, Mr. Cool?

12:51.686 --> 12:53.285
I wonder if my sense of aesthetics

12:53.606 --> 12:55.325
has been spoiled by you

12:55.405 --> 12:56.125
since I was young.

12:56.365 --> 12:57.526
Now I find the campus hunk

12:57.606 --> 12:58.726
of my school quite average.

12:58.806 --> 12:59.806
I mean it.

13:00.606 --> 13:03.445
Do you know what Luo Dan said?

13:03.886 --> 13:04.886
Luo Dan?

13:05.325 --> 13:06.445
My high school classmate

13:06.766 --> 13:08.045
who got into your art academy.

13:10.886 --> 13:11.886
He said,

13:12.365 --> 13:15.486
"Back in high school,
the campus hunk was Chen Luzhou.

13:15.806 --> 13:18.045
Now in college, the campus hunk
is still Chen Luzhou.

13:18.445 --> 13:19.766
Even my dad has remarried twice.

13:19.846 --> 13:21.285
But the campus hunk hasn't changed."

13:23.405 --> 13:24.405
Then I'll go.

13:25.205 --> 13:26.526
That's more like it.

13:27.405 --> 13:28.445
Don't bottle it up

13:28.726 --> 13:29.445
next time.

13:29.726 --> 13:30.726
Just speak out.

13:30.966 --> 13:31.966
At least,

13:32.125 --> 13:33.125
we can drink it away.

13:34.245 --> 13:35.526
We can drink until morning.

13:36.365 --> 13:37.365
Until morning?

13:37.726 --> 13:38.726
You're that free?

13:39.045 --> 13:39.487
Nothing

13:39.567 --> 13:42.005
is more important than consoling

13:42.205 --> 13:42.846
my lovesick bro,

13:43.045 --> 13:44.045
right?

13:49.325 --> 13:51.325
I really don't want
to go back to my dorm room.

13:52.445 --> 13:53.406
Can I go to your place

13:53.486 --> 13:54.125
and squeeze in?

13:54.486 --> 13:56.005
My dorm bed? Forget it.

13:56.205 --> 13:57.646
I can barely fit myself.

13:58.245 --> 13:59.365
I'll get you a hotel room.

13:59.445 --> 14:00.445
You can stay there.

14:00.566 --> 14:01.566
Sure.

14:02.325 --> 14:03.566
A presidential suite, please.

14:03.846 --> 14:04.846
You're dreaming.

14:05.766 --> 14:06.925
Given my current situation,

14:07.005 --> 14:08.005
if you're really my bro,

14:08.686 --> 14:09.926
you should sleep in a park.

14:11.205 --> 14:12.486
You heartless man.

14:18.726 --> 14:20.245
Fill it up, Chen Luzhou.

14:23.606 --> 14:24.606
Alright.

14:26.365 --> 14:27.526
Fill it up.

14:27.606 --> 14:28.686
Fill it up.

14:29.085 --> 14:30.085
Wait,

14:31.205 --> 14:32.526
aren't you my bro?

14:33.125 --> 14:34.125
Of course, I am.

14:35.045 --> 14:36.686
You can't hold your liquor,

14:36.766 --> 14:37.806
weakling.

14:37.886 --> 14:39.005
Yeah, I'm a weakling.

14:39.085 --> 14:40.325
Pour some more.

14:43.886 --> 14:45.886
I'm not even drunk.

14:47.806 --> 14:50.245
Okay, we'll drink next time, alright?

14:50.325 --> 14:51.766
If you're my bro, just sleep well.

15:05.342 --> 15:12.824
(Conman's Quote:
I will always be by your side.)

15:59.966 --> 16:00.925
Chen Luzhou,

16:01.005 --> 16:02.526
can't you see what time it is now?

16:02.966 --> 16:04.045
Why are you still studying?

16:05.125 --> 16:07.085
Is it necessary to be so competitive?

16:08.846 --> 16:10.165
Fine, go ahead and study.

16:10.886 --> 16:11.886
Study to death.

16:34.966 --> 16:36.486
You have class to attend to now?

16:39.245 --> 16:39.686
Today...

16:39.926 --> 16:41.686
Wait, it's Saturday today.

16:42.045 --> 16:43.045
I'm going back to school

16:44.045 --> 16:45.245
to have breakfast with Xu Zhi.

16:46.766 --> 16:47.766
Wait.

16:57.646 --> 17:00.846
Feeling sulky,
yet going to have breakfast with her.

17:02.285 --> 17:04.806
Chen Luzhou, you are hopeless.

17:14.814 --> 17:17.103
(Girls' Dormitory)

17:18.782 --> 17:23.000
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

17:25.048 --> 17:29.814
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

17:32.120 --> 17:36.112
♪The world is too quiet♪

17:37.630 --> 17:42.968
♪Amplify every sound♪

17:45.496 --> 17:51.587
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

17:51.998 --> 17:54.904
♪The lonely clock♪

17:55.032 --> 17:59.799
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

18:00.056 --> 18:03.385
♪Are we both♪

18:04.286 --> 18:07.218
♪Attracted to each other♪

18:08.120 --> 18:13.396
♪Falling into you♪

19:16.285 --> 19:17.325
(Have you gotten up?)

19:23.926 --> 19:25.966
That's all for today's class.

19:26.405 --> 19:27.766
(Architectural Drawing)
If you have more questions,

19:27.966 --> 19:29.045
you can come to me.

19:35.405 --> 19:37.446
(Where are you?
What time is the afternoon game?)

19:37.526 --> 19:38.206
No.

19:38.286 --> 19:39.806
I must change my major next year.

19:40.165 --> 19:42.526
I really can't stand
staying up late every day.

19:42.926 --> 19:44.446
I couldn't help dozing off yesterday

19:44.526 --> 19:46.405
and dreamt that Mr. Hu told me,

19:46.886 --> 19:49.205
"You drew well. Don't ever draw again."

19:50.486 --> 19:51.486
It was so scary.

19:54.766 --> 19:55.766
What's wrong?

19:57.325 --> 19:58.646
Fought with your ex-boyfriend?

19:59.405 --> 19:59.966
No.

20:00.405 --> 20:01.405
What ex-boyfriend?

20:04.526 --> 20:05.526
Gong Zhu,

20:05.846 --> 20:06.886
can you do me a favor?

20:07.325 --> 20:09.365
My high school classmate
is coming this afternoon.

20:09.486 --> 20:10.886
So you can't go to Chen Luzhou's

20:10.966 --> 20:11.806
match today?

20:11.966 --> 20:13.965
Don't worry.
We two will cheer for him for you.

20:14.045 --> 20:14.646
Right?

20:14.726 --> 20:15.726
No.

20:16.165 --> 20:17.365
I'd like you to

20:17.445 --> 20:18.686
show my friend around for me.

20:19.165 --> 20:20.606
Show him around?

20:20.686 --> 20:22.325
I want to watch hot guys
play basketball.

20:22.606 --> 20:24.245
I also want to watch my boyfriend play.

20:24.726 --> 20:25.806
Boyfriend...

20:25.926 --> 20:26.926
Thanks.

20:30.285 --> 20:31.445
- Boyfriend?
- Boyfriend?

20:32.486 --> 20:33.806
Are you two really together?

20:33.886 --> 20:34.886
Xu Zhi?

20:35.886 --> 20:37.606
Go, go!

20:39.005 --> 20:40.005
Come on!

20:41.526 --> 20:43.085
Zhao Tianqi, go!

20:43.165 --> 20:44.165
Come on!

20:50.205 --> 20:51.285
So cool.

21:02.566 --> 21:03.566
Xu Zhi.

21:06.205 --> 21:07.566
Go, go!

21:07.926 --> 21:08.807
You good? It's hot.

21:08.887 --> 21:10.245
It's boiling hot.

21:11.325 --> 21:12.566
Let's eat ice cream later.

21:13.245 --> 21:15.005
But you were really cool just now.

21:15.085 --> 21:15.846
- Right?
- Yes.

21:15.926 --> 21:16.926
I found it cool too.

21:17.846 --> 21:18.486
Super cool.

21:18.806 --> 21:19.245
Right?

21:19.646 --> 21:20.365
One more game?

21:20.445 --> 21:20.966
Sure.

21:21.046 --> 21:22.125
You're up quite early.

21:24.766 --> 21:25.846
Where is your phone?

21:26.846 --> 21:27.846
In the dorm, charging.

21:29.486 --> 21:30.806
You didn't bring your phone?

21:32.566 --> 21:33.566
You can search.

21:38.526 --> 21:39.526
What time is it?

21:39.726 --> 21:40.726
4:30 PM.

21:41.926 --> 21:43.165
Tell Zhu Yangqi

21:43.405 --> 21:44.526
that we're together

21:44.686 --> 21:46.085
and he can get to me through you.

21:48.886 --> 21:51.045
When Zhu Yangqi contacts you,
you want your phone.

21:51.806 --> 21:53.566
When I contact you,
your phone is charging.

21:54.205 --> 21:55.205
Are you tired of me?

21:57.486 --> 21:58.766
You actually asked that?

22:00.445 --> 22:02.045
You would tire first if we were to.

22:12.806 --> 22:13.806
What's with your mouth?

22:15.445 --> 22:16.606
Got hit while playing.

22:25.085 --> 22:26.085
Can you play basketball?

22:26.205 --> 22:27.205
Not really.

22:27.365 --> 22:28.365
What about shooting?

22:28.686 --> 22:29.766
Not really either.

22:31.806 --> 22:33.005
Let's have a shootout of ten.

22:33.766 --> 22:34.406
If you win,

22:34.486 --> 22:35.486
I'll grant you a request.

22:40.766 --> 22:41.926
Do you want to lose or win?

22:43.606 --> 22:44.886
Of course, I want to win.

22:45.526 --> 22:46.766
I'll spot you four goals.

22:47.165 --> 22:48.446
Ten for me, and six for you.

22:48.526 --> 22:50.285
I advise you to give up.

22:52.325 --> 22:53.325
I won't.

23:00.205 --> 23:01.486
At least make an effort.

23:01.926 --> 23:03.526
Otherwise, it'd make me look easy.

23:04.886 --> 23:05.886
Are you serious?

23:10.165 --> 23:11.446
(Would you like to grab a meal?)

23:11.526 --> 23:13.165
(To thank you in person before I go.)

23:17.926 --> 23:19.325
If you are going to him,

23:22.125 --> 23:23.566
don't come to me again anymore.

23:27.566 --> 23:28.766
I'm done wasting time.

23:28.846 --> 23:29.846
That's it for us.

23:33.325 --> 23:34.405
You saw him yesterday?

23:50.846 --> 23:52.365
Do you really think that way?

23:55.085 --> 23:56.325
I thought you knew me.

23:56.405 --> 23:57.405
Come on.

23:58.686 --> 23:59.766
I admit defeat.

24:00.526 --> 24:01.926
If someone really pursues me,

24:02.365 --> 24:04.045
wouldn't you just cheer them on?

24:06.566 --> 24:07.925
If you truly care about me,

24:08.005 --> 24:09.045
would you do that,

24:09.125 --> 24:10.125
Xu Zhi?

24:12.165 --> 24:14.165
It's okay that you gave him a tour
of the campus.

24:15.245 --> 24:16.686
But you should have told me.

24:16.886 --> 24:17.966
What am I to you?

24:19.405 --> 24:21.005
What do you think you're to me?

24:24.285 --> 24:26.085
Don't you know
I have no feelings for him?

24:27.486 --> 24:28.486
But he cares about you.

24:28.926 --> 24:29.926
He has feelings for you.

24:30.526 --> 24:31.886
Do you know what I would do

24:31.966 --> 24:33.005
if Gu Yan came today?

24:33.165 --> 24:36.005
I would never meet her
without telling you.

24:53.846 --> 24:55.686
Xu Zhi, you're not someone
who can't say no.

24:58.005 --> 24:59.846
You just don't care about my feelings.

25:09.165 --> 25:10.552
If that's the case, forget it.

25:10.712 --> 25:14.071
♪On a midsummer night♪

25:14.526 --> 25:19.828
♪The streetlights gradually awaken♪

25:20.926 --> 25:24.441
♪The moonlight
penetrates the tree shades♪

25:24.862 --> 25:29.514
♪Chasing the distance
between you and me♪

25:31.134 --> 25:33.208
♪On the mountaintop
where the shooting stars pass♪

25:33.662 --> 25:35.781
♪The silhouette is frozen in eternity♪

25:36.254 --> 25:38.552
♪Fireworks, cicadas chirping,
heartbeat breathing♪

25:38.814 --> 25:41.144
♪The whole world pauses♪

25:42.014 --> 25:44.889
♪Messages connecting the universe♪

25:46.654 --> 25:48.605
♪Billions of shooting stars♪

25:49.246 --> 25:51.512
♪Following the path of the galaxy♪

25:51.806 --> 25:54.310
♪Falling into your eyes♪

25:54.430 --> 25:56.728
♪Oh, oh, oh♪

25:56.958 --> 25:58.822
♪Billions of raindrops♪

25:59.294 --> 26:02.040
♪Like the universe's response♪

26:02.174 --> 26:04.457
♪Landing in my heart's depth♪

26:04.686 --> 26:07.005
(I guess you're busy.
So I won't disturb you.)

26:07.726 --> 26:08.966
(I'm going back to Qingyi now.)

26:09.245 --> 26:10.245
(See you next time.)

26:14.942 --> 26:18.191
♪We met across billions of light-years♪

26:19.230 --> 26:21.587
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

26:21.822 --> 26:23.960
♪Ah, ah, ah♪

26:24.224 --> 26:26.424
(Sunflower)

26:40.646 --> 26:41.646
Xu Zhi.

26:43.205 --> 26:44.205
Here, milk tea.

26:45.325 --> 26:46.646
I can't drink anymore.

26:46.846 --> 26:48.445
Chen Luzhou asked me to bring it to you.

26:49.245 --> 26:50.245
Chen Luzhou?

26:51.445 --> 26:53.365
His captain was handing out milk tea
to the team

26:53.445 --> 26:54.886
and asked him if he wanted some.

26:55.125 --> 26:57.045
He said no at first

26:57.125 --> 26:58.245
but took one in the end.

27:02.766 --> 27:03.766
I have to go.

27:18.165 --> 27:19.445
Finally got through.

27:19.886 --> 27:21.526
I called Chen Luzhou all afternoon.

27:22.005 --> 27:24.125
I almost thought
you two vanished into thin air.

27:24.285 --> 27:26.486
He is playing basketball
and didn't bring his phone.

27:27.566 --> 27:29.205
Okay. I'm glad he's still alive.

27:29.566 --> 27:30.606
Are you busy now?

27:31.085 --> 27:32.365
I'm right beside your school.

27:32.646 --> 27:34.325
If you're free, let's have a meal.

27:44.045 --> 27:45.606
Zhi, let's start eating first

27:45.686 --> 27:46.686
and not wait for him.

27:47.125 --> 27:47.926
I'm starving.

27:48.125 --> 27:49.325
Are you sure?

27:50.966 --> 27:52.806
Who knows when he'll be done?

27:53.646 --> 27:54.445
I'm telling you.

27:54.606 --> 27:56.726
Guys take forever
after playing basketball.

27:57.405 --> 27:59.486
They need to shower, fix their hair,
and get changed.

28:00.005 --> 28:01.445
It takes hours at least.

28:02.325 --> 28:02.966
Let's eat first.

28:03.205 --> 28:03.807
You're here.

28:03.887 --> 28:05.325
So he'll definitely come.

28:05.526 --> 28:06.526
No, he won't.

28:07.486 --> 28:08.886
Is he still being jealous?

28:09.085 --> 28:10.085
Did he tell you?

28:10.205 --> 28:11.205
Yes.

28:11.606 --> 28:13.926
Last night, I drank with him until dawn.

28:14.486 --> 28:15.686
Didn't he go at around 4 AM

28:15.766 --> 28:17.085
to have breakfast with you?

28:17.926 --> 28:19.445
I thought he figured it out himself.

28:19.966 --> 28:21.005
I didn't know.

28:22.285 --> 28:23.646
I didn't know he came to see me.

28:24.165 --> 28:25.285
I stayed up late last night.

28:25.365 --> 28:26.606
So I overslept in the morning.

28:28.365 --> 28:29.365
That's bad.

28:31.245 --> 28:33.566
He was upset
and went to have breakfast with you.

28:33.926 --> 28:36.085
But in the end, he waited all morning

28:36.886 --> 28:37.886
and never saw you.

28:38.285 --> 28:39.325
He must be more upset now.

28:46.926 --> 28:48.005
What should I do?

28:50.165 --> 28:52.085
Zhi, I...

28:53.005 --> 28:55.085
I'm just telling you this.

28:55.806 --> 28:57.245
Don't mention it to him later.

28:57.566 --> 28:58.487
Because I...

28:58.567 --> 29:00.165
I haven't shared these thoughts
with him.

29:00.365 --> 29:01.245
Go ahead.

29:01.365 --> 29:02.526
Chen Luzhou

29:02.806 --> 29:04.766
appears to be carefree,

29:04.846 --> 29:05.886
caring about nothing.

29:06.646 --> 29:07.686
But when it comes to you,

29:07.926 --> 29:09.245
he cares a lot.

29:11.486 --> 29:13.646
He knows
you have no feelings for Tan Xu.

29:14.085 --> 29:15.085
But Tan Xu

29:15.165 --> 29:17.285
spent two years with you.

29:17.806 --> 29:19.566
You studied and progressed together.

29:20.125 --> 29:21.205
While Chen Luzhou

29:21.686 --> 29:23.245
has only known you for a few months.

29:24.285 --> 29:26.526
And most of the time you were apart.

29:28.045 --> 29:29.045
I know.

29:29.726 --> 29:30.806
He has

29:31.045 --> 29:32.566
very high standards for himself.

29:33.365 --> 29:35.365
Whatever it is, he forces himself

29:35.445 --> 29:36.445
to do his best.

29:37.365 --> 29:38.566
Sometimes I even think

29:39.966 --> 29:41.205
he's quite stubborn.

29:43.085 --> 29:45.045
But I know he does that
because he doesn't have

29:45.285 --> 29:46.526
much sense of security.

29:49.245 --> 29:52.005
Actually, as his friends,
we often tease him,

29:52.325 --> 29:53.486
saying he's a mama's boy

29:53.566 --> 29:54.566
or something like that.

29:55.445 --> 29:56.445
But actually

29:57.245 --> 29:58.966
he's never spoiled enough
to act wishfully.

30:01.205 --> 30:02.325
In elementary school,

30:02.486 --> 30:03.606
he ranked top in the class.

30:04.245 --> 30:05.245
But his mom believed

30:05.365 --> 30:06.766
it was nothing to be top in class.

30:07.365 --> 30:10.125
In the middle school entrance exam,
he topped the city.

30:11.806 --> 30:13.445
He listened to his parents

30:13.526 --> 30:15.085
to transfer schools or go abroad.

30:15.445 --> 30:17.405
(He keeps adapting to new environments.)

30:18.846 --> 30:20.285
(Although he went through all this,)

30:20.726 --> 30:22.245
(he never told us.)

30:22.726 --> 30:23.806
(He digested)

30:23.886 --> 30:25.125
(all the bad emotions alone.)

30:26.486 --> 30:28.926
(Actually, in these few months
he disappeared,)

30:29.445 --> 30:30.966
(a lot happened.)

30:32.325 --> 30:34.846
(In Ruicheng, he nearly died.)

30:35.606 --> 30:37.405
(Upon his return,
his parents got a divorce.)

30:38.566 --> 30:39.926
(Although he's said nothing,)

30:41.045 --> 30:42.566
(every step he takes)

30:43.085 --> 30:44.806
(is an effort toward you.)

30:46.005 --> 30:47.806
(I only found out recently as well)

30:48.045 --> 30:49.646
(that the night we had a gathering,)

30:49.846 --> 30:51.846
(he secretly took your black hair tie)

30:52.766 --> 30:54.405
(and has always worn it on his wrist.)

30:56.734 --> 31:00.007
♪The moment I hug you♪

31:00.286 --> 31:07.519
♪Let every chapter of the story align♪

31:09.694 --> 31:12.952
♪Even if it rains on you♪

31:13.150 --> 31:16.736
♪I will always be with you♪

31:17.374 --> 31:20.613
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

31:20.894 --> 31:23.480
♪Our love will last♪

31:23.582 --> 31:26.946
♪Even if it rains on you♪

31:27.896 --> 31:32.280
(You passed the add-on admission.)

31:34.910 --> 31:38.200
♪You're the only one♪

31:38.366 --> 31:40.952
♪When the rain blurs the world♪

31:41.374 --> 31:45.336
♪Parallel distance♪

31:46.174 --> 31:48.449
♪With you♪

31:48.798 --> 31:51.792
♪The splendid, sunny memories♪

31:52.286 --> 31:55.185
♪Mend uneasy dreams♪

31:55.602 --> 31:58.040
(Zhi)

31:58.398 --> 32:01.720
♪Even if it rains on you♪

32:01.822 --> 32:05.898
♪I will always be with you♪

32:06.014 --> 32:09.148
♪Like a rainbow appears♪

32:09.598 --> 32:12.200
♪Our love will last♪

32:12.280 --> 32:15.575
♪Even if it rains on you♪

32:16.245 --> 32:18.846
(Zhu Yangqi, can you do me a favor?)

32:31.045 --> 32:32.405
Even if I die...

32:34.045 --> 32:35.045
Die...

32:35.846 --> 32:36.846
Wait a moment.

32:37.726 --> 32:38.726
Wait a moment.

32:39.125 --> 32:39.846
Die....

32:40.005 --> 32:41.766
Alright, get off.

32:41.846 --> 32:42.846
Let me.

32:44.566 --> 32:45.646
How did the song go?

32:46.405 --> 32:47.405
Set a pitch.

32:48.886 --> 32:49.526
Even if I die...

32:49.686 --> 32:50.726
Lucy, you're here.

32:52.726 --> 32:53.806
Come on, sit down.

32:57.205 --> 32:58.846
You're late. You have to sing a song.

33:00.285 --> 33:00.727
Come on.

33:00.807 --> 33:01.846
See what song you want.

33:01.926 --> 33:03.325
I'll pass. You guys go ahead.

33:04.646 --> 33:05.326
No.

33:05.406 --> 33:06.526
Just pick one.

33:06.886 --> 33:08.005
Sing one.

33:10.806 --> 33:11.886
No one is singing?

33:13.325 --> 33:14.165
Then I'll sing.

33:14.245 --> 33:15.726
Pick my theme song for me.

33:16.205 --> 33:17.205
Okay.

33:22.445 --> 33:23.445
Applause.

33:24.686 --> 33:25.766
Sing.

33:27.205 --> 33:32.766
♪If a heavy rain falls♪

33:34.726 --> 33:38.486
♪Let me♪

33:38.926 --> 33:42.165
♪Become the ocean♪

33:42.245 --> 33:46.925
♪With all those seemingly constraining♪

33:47.005 --> 33:50.886
♪But actually love-woven♪

33:50.966 --> 33:55.245
♪Waves♪

33:57.486 --> 34:03.606
♪If the heavy rain remains♪

34:05.125 --> 34:10.766
♪Maybe, I'll forget to go home♪

34:14.085 --> 34:15.405
Ask him if he has eaten.

34:15.846 --> 34:17.806
If he hasn't, he can order food here.

34:18.325 --> 34:19.325
Got it.

34:21.646 --> 34:22.285
Lucy,

34:22.606 --> 34:25.285
she wants to know
if her sweetheart has eaten.

34:26.445 --> 34:27.966
You added 'sweetheart', right?

34:28.325 --> 34:29.886
No, I don't have the experience.

34:31.005 --> 34:32.325
I'm not ordering. I'm not hungry.

34:34.606 --> 34:37.125
Lucy said he wants you to feed him.

34:38.045 --> 34:39.205
I can hear you.

34:40.405 --> 34:42.966
♪The sun♪

34:46.205 --> 34:51.325
♪If a heavy rain falls♪

34:53.165 --> 34:54.646
It sounds great.

34:58.125 --> 35:00.205
Yingying, doesn't your school
have a curfew?

35:00.285 --> 35:01.405
I remember it's 0:00.

35:01.486 --> 35:02.205
It does?

35:02.285 --> 35:03.285
Yes.

35:04.325 --> 35:04.886
Yes.

35:05.205 --> 35:07.285
The school gate is closed at 0:00.

35:07.606 --> 35:08.926
Should I take you back to school?

35:09.085 --> 35:10.205
Sure, let's go.

35:10.445 --> 35:11.526
Let's go. Hurry.

35:15.566 --> 35:17.846
By the way,
this room's available till 6 AM.

35:17.926 --> 35:19.245
Sing well and chat well.

35:19.445 --> 35:20.246
Don't waste it.

35:20.326 --> 35:21.406
Don't waste it.

35:21.486 --> 35:22.486
- Go.
- Let's go.

35:47.085 --> 35:49.205
Luzhou is so hard to deal with.

35:49.285 --> 35:50.566
I've known Zhi for years.

35:50.646 --> 35:52.806
I've never seen her
be so humble to anyone.

35:52.966 --> 35:54.045
If you put it that way,

35:54.125 --> 35:55.965
Lucy has never been so upset before.

35:56.045 --> 35:56.766
Alright?

35:57.005 --> 35:57.326
He's

35:57.406 --> 35:59.085
been so stifled these past few months.

35:59.646 --> 36:00.646
He can let it out a bit.

36:00.766 --> 36:02.085
Lucy blah blah.

36:05.285 --> 36:08.005
Letting it out is fine,
but there should be a limit.

36:08.085 --> 36:09.085
Right?

36:09.165 --> 36:10.006
I think this time,

36:10.086 --> 36:12.365
Lucy has indeed been a bit dramatic.

36:15.726 --> 36:18.526
When I called you that day
after getting drunk,

36:18.806 --> 36:20.085
did I say anything wrong?

36:23.806 --> 36:24.806
What do you think?

36:25.766 --> 36:27.205
- Water, Lucy.
- I'll go buy some.

36:35.566 --> 36:36.726
Thank you all for watching.

36:36.806 --> 36:38.125
See you next episode.

36:39.486 --> 36:40.965
Thank you, audience, for watching.

36:41.045 --> 36:42.566
(Broadcast Host)
See you in the next episode.

36:49.405 --> 36:50.726
Hello, what's up?

36:51.405 --> 36:52.405
Hello?

36:53.886 --> 36:56.726
Is this the host, the lovely Ms. Cai?

36:57.846 --> 36:59.405
Are you drunk?

36:59.886 --> 37:00.366
Yingying,

37:00.446 --> 37:03.566
do you prefer muscular or skinny men?

37:04.245 --> 37:07.005
Can you at least give me a goal?

37:07.726 --> 37:09.365
Gaining muscle is hard enough.

37:09.445 --> 37:10.766
I also need to lose fat.

37:11.606 --> 37:13.245
I really can't take it anymore.

37:14.486 --> 37:15.606
Stylish Zhu,

37:16.125 --> 37:17.205
you don't need to change.

37:17.846 --> 37:19.205
You're fine as you are now.

37:20.886 --> 37:21.886
Wait.

37:22.165 --> 37:24.445
I can also beatbox. Do you like it?

37:40.846 --> 37:41.846
I'm really sorry

37:41.926 --> 37:42.926
for torturing your ears.

37:43.125 --> 37:44.125
That's it?

37:44.365 --> 37:45.846
Also, I promise

37:45.926 --> 37:47.285
I'll control myself.

37:47.365 --> 37:48.566
No more drunk drama.

37:48.646 --> 37:49.925
You better keep your promise.

37:50.005 --> 37:51.005
I will.

38:01.846 --> 38:02.447
Put it on.

38:02.527 --> 38:03.606
You're in short sleeves.

38:03.686 --> 38:04.326
I'm fine.

38:04.406 --> 38:05.646
I'm all muscles.

38:05.766 --> 38:06.766
Quickly put it on.

38:26.566 --> 38:27.566
Well,

38:28.445 --> 38:28.887
it's late.

38:28.967 --> 38:29.925
Let me take you back.

38:30.005 --> 38:31.445
No, I can take a taxi myself.

38:31.566 --> 38:33.205
No, your school is so far.

38:33.445 --> 38:35.526
It's so late, and you're a girl alone.

38:36.005 --> 38:37.005
I can't let you go alone.

38:38.886 --> 38:39.886
Alright.

38:48.045 --> 38:51.966
♪Both of us lack something♪

38:55.365 --> 39:00.005
♪That's why we instantly become unhappy♪

39:01.365 --> 39:08.405
♪It's hard to be simple,
for there are many burdens♪

39:08.886 --> 39:15.486
♪I'm brave, but I still feel sad♪

39:17.325 --> 39:22.165
♪In life, there are choices♪

39:24.966 --> 39:30.245
♪But wisdom often comes
after the closes♪

39:30.846 --> 39:38.325
♪My emotions are a mess.
My words are harsh♪

39:38.405 --> 39:44.726
♪Communication just falls short♪

39:45.285 --> 39:49.005
♪Perhaps only you understand me♪

39:49.085 --> 39:52.886
♪So you didn't escape♪

39:52.966 --> 39:56.365
♪While crying, you tightly hug me♪

39:56.445 --> 40:00.886
♪Whispering how much you love me♪

40:00.966 --> 40:03.806
♪Only you understand me♪

40:03.886 --> 40:07.285
♪Like a trapped beast♪

40:07.766 --> 40:13.085
♪In skyscrapers, longing for freedom♪

40:19.606 --> 40:21.886
I didn't handle
the matter about Tan Xu well.

40:26.285 --> 40:27.285
I'll drink to apologize.

40:43.886 --> 40:44.886
Enough.

40:47.926 --> 40:48.926
Stop drinking.

41:00.245 --> 41:02.245
I booked a room for Cai Yingying.

41:02.526 --> 41:03.606
Before I could say it,

41:03.886 --> 41:05.325
she left with Zhu Yangqi.

41:05.646 --> 41:07.646
I'll still be charged
if I cancel the room.

41:07.726 --> 41:09.245
Maybe I shouldn't cancel it.

41:11.285 --> 41:12.806
If not canceled, who will sleep there?

41:15.245 --> 41:16.245
I will.

41:46.806 --> 41:47.806
Let's go.

42:07.806 --> 42:08.806
Over there.

42:09.365 --> 42:10.606
Why haven't you gone back yet?

42:11.646 --> 42:12.646
I'll see you to the door.

42:40.566 --> 42:41.566
This is it.

42:42.125 --> 42:43.125
Bye-bye.

43:54.646 --> 43:56.085
What's going on?

44:07.230 --> 44:13.208
♪Listen to the cicadas in the midsummer♪

44:14.206 --> 44:17.207
♪The reflection in your eyes♪

44:18.846 --> 44:20.045
Why are you still here?

44:22.245 --> 44:23.365
Don't you want me to stay?

44:24.846 --> 44:26.045
You want to stay so much?

44:29.182 --> 44:32.632
♪The roar of the heartbeat♪

44:33.502 --> 44:38.333
♪Drew a trajectory♪

44:39.070 --> 44:44.824
♪Crush, when night meets dawn♪

44:47.102 --> 44:53.037
♪Crush, rushing to you in the crowd♪

44:56.285 --> 44:57.285
Yes.

44:58.526 --> 45:00.045
I'd regret if I left like that.

45:03.006 --> 45:07.384
♪How you long for the future♪

45:07.646 --> 45:10.798
♪Charging recklessly, getting hurt♪

45:10.878 --> 45:13.482
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

45:13.694 --> 45:17.554
♪If tears fill your eyes♪

45:18.558 --> 45:22.830
♪Let the damp wind stay in memories♪

45:22.910 --> 45:28.643
♪We stand by each other among the crowd♪

45:29.662 --> 45:33.496
♪The endless clear sky
disperses the rainy season♪

45:33.598 --> 45:36.504
♪Taking away all the mud♪

45:37.854 --> 45:41.016
♪Leaving an echo♪

45:41.278 --> 45:45.312
♪Baby, fall in my heart♪

45:46.194 --> 45:49.564
(Although he's said nothing,)

45:49.644 --> 45:52.792
(every step he takes)

45:52.792 --> 45:59.346
(is an effort toward you.)

46:00.224 --> 46:06.040
♪Like a cloud drifting away♪

46:06.592 --> 46:12.120
♪Freely crossing the vast sky♪

46:13.632 --> 46:18.080
♪The world is too quiet♪

46:19.072 --> 46:26.000
♪Amplifying all the sounds♪

46:26.912 --> 46:32.000
♪Who will visit me♪

46:33.056 --> 46:38.680
♪Treading carefully
into my personal space♪

46:39.424 --> 46:42.480
♪Turning the frozen loneliness♪

46:42.720 --> 46:48.040
♪Into concern and care♪

46:53.568 --> 46:58.680
♪Watching stars rise and fall♪

46:59.200 --> 47:05.040
♪Gently pushing me to tour your world♪

47:06.496 --> 47:09.880
♪Swirling into a vortex♪

47:10.016 --> 47:16.240
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

47:16.736 --> 47:19.680
♪The lonely clock♪

47:19.840 --> 47:24.440
♪A relentless pursuit, day and night♪

47:24.832 --> 47:28.080
♪Are we both♪

47:28.352 --> 47:31.880
♪Attracted to each other♪

47:33.024 --> 47:39.640
♪Falling into you♪

47:43.360 --> 47:49.160
♪You are the whirlwind
changing the course of our future♪

47:50.016 --> 47:52.680
♪Just a few more embraces away♪

47:53.216 --> 47:57.840
♪From reaching eternity♪

47:58.240 --> 48:01.520
♪After rushing recklessly♪

48:01.728 --> 48:05.160
♪We approach each other♪

48:06.432 --> 48:10.040
♪Without turning back♪

48:11.424 --> 48:19.080
♪In your eyes, I see myself♪

48:19.712 --> 48:26.200
♪Falling into you♪
